{'symbol': 'HAS', 'date': '2019-11-04 22:30:00', 'title': 'CERTAIN COMMON STOCK OF HASBRO, INC. ARE SUBJECT TO A LOCK-UP AGREEMENT ENDING ON 5-JAN-2020.', 'text': 'CERTAIN COMMON STOCK OF HASBRO, INC. ARE SUBJECT TO A LOCK-UP AGREEMENT ENDING ON 5-JAN-2020. THESE COMMON STOCK WILL BE UNDER LOCKUP FOR 61 DAYS STARTING FROM 5-NOV-2019 TO 5-JAN-2020.\n\nDETAILS:\nTHE EXECUTIVE OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, AND ALL OF THE HOLDERS OF EQUITY SECURITIES HAVE ENTERED INTO A LOCK UP AGREEMENT PURSUANT TO WHICH, THEY WILL NOT TO DISPOSING OR PLEDGING, OR HEDGING AGAINST, COMMON STOCK OR SECURITIES CONVERTIBLE INTO OR EXCHANGEABLE FOR SHARES OF COMMON STOCK FOR A PERIOD OF 60 DAYS AFTER THE DATE OF THE FINAL PROSPECTUS, WITHOUT THE PRIOR WRITTEN CONSENT OF THE BOFA SECURITIES, INC., J.P. MORGAN SECURITIES LLC AND CITIGROUP GLOBAL MARKETS INC, ON BEHALF OF THE UNDERWRITERS.'}{'symbol': 'HAS', 'date': '2019-11-04 20:30:00', 'title': 'HASBRO ANNOUNCES PUBLIC OFFERING OF COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'HASBRO ANNOUNCES PUBLIC OFFERING OF COMMON STOCK.HASBRO INC - HAS COMMENCED AN UNDERWRITTEN REGISTERED PUBLIC OFFERING OF $875.0 MILLION OF SHARES OF ITS COMMON STOCK.HASBRO INC - INTENDS TO USE NET PROCEEDS OF OFFERING TO FINANCE, IN PART, ITS PROPOSED ACQUISITION OF ENTERTAINMENT ONE LTD.'}{'symbol': 'HAS', 'date': '2019-11-03 22:30:00', 'title': 'HASBRO, INC. HAS FILED A FOLLOW-ON EQUITY OFFERING IN THE AMOUNT OF $875 MILLION.', 'text': 'HASBRO, INC. HAS FILED A FOLLOW-ON EQUITY OFFERING IN THE AMOUNT OF $875 MILLION.\n\nSECURITY NAME: COMMON STOCK\nSECURITY TYPE: COMMON STOCK\n'}